    "Backs up subscriptions, full playback history, queue, AI analyses, and settings as a single JSON file. Restore on a new device with smart merge — your existing data is never deleted. Local audio, captions, and credentials are not included." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将订阅、完整播放历史、队列、AI 分析和设置备份为单个 JSON 文件。在新设备上通过智能合并恢复——绝不会删除你现有的数据。不包含本地音频、字幕和凭据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
