    "Skip intervals also apply to lock screen and headphone controls. Auto-play continues from the Up Next queue when it would otherwise stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快进／快退间隔同样适用于锁屏和耳机控制。在本应停止时，自动播放会从“接下来”队列继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快轉／倒退間隔同樣適用於鎖定畫面和耳機控制。在本應停止時，自動播放會從「接下來」佇列繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip intervals apply to in-app controls and lock screen/headphone buttons." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快进／快退间隔适用于应用内控制以及锁屏／耳机按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快轉／倒退間隔適用於 App 內控制以及鎖定畫面／耳機按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skips chain-of-thought reasoning for faster responses. Best for DeepSeek-R1 and other reasoning models." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
